BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:R.L. Stine’s Goosebumps The Musical: Phantom of the Auditorium\,
  shows at 11 & 2
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T130000
UID:93044db3a8888e84f215783a7f2060c4@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:When Brooke and Zeke are cast in their school’s spooky new p
 lay\, The Phantom \, they start to wonder if the show is actually cursed. 
 As strange messages appear and rehearsals are disrupted by a mysterious ma
 sked figure\, they must uncover the truth: is it all an elaborate prank…
  or is their theater truly haunted? Full of catchy songs\, laugh-out-loud 
 moments\, and just the right amount of Halloween-season chills\, this musi
 cal mystery is perfect for kids\, tweens\, and grown-ups who remember read
 ing by flashlight. Fun for all ages!
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium\, 122 South Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/r-l-stines-goosebumps-the-musical-phantom-of-t
 he-auditorium-shows-at-11-2/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
