DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join us for a night of music\, art\, and co
 mmunity. Live music performances by Time Well Spent\, The U-Station Agents
 \, and more. Flash Tattoos by Jason Profant\, Julian/bblackhoundd\, and Ha
 ley/Yelah Tattoos. Essay and poetry readings by members of Women Writing f
 or (a) Change. Food from Erika Yochum and Pili’s Party Truck. Cash Bar. 
